#: ../../library/gzip.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`gzip` --- gzip compression & decompression"
msgstr ":mod:`gzip` --- gzip kompresija i dekompresija"

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module allows compression and decompression of binary data with the "
"`DEFLATE algorithm <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE>`_ used by the "
"gzip file format.  It provides one-shot :func:`compress`/:func:`decompress` "
"helpers and a streaming :class:`GzipFile` wrapper around an underlying file "
"or stream object."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul omogućuje kompresiju i dekompresiju binarnih podataka pomoću "
"`DEFLATE algoritma <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE>`_ koji koristi "
"gzip format datoteke.  Pruža jednokratne pomoćne funkcije :func:`compress`\\"
" /\\ :func:`decompress` i strujni :class:`GzipFile` omotač oko temeljnog "
"objekta datoteke ili toka."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:13
msgid ""
"Prefer to use :class:`deflate.DeflateIO` instead of the functions in this "
"module as it provides a streaming interface to compression and decompression"
" which is convenient and more memory efficient when working with reading or "
"writing compressed data to a file, socket, or stream."
msgstr ""
"Preferirajte korištenje :class:`deflate.DeflateIO` umjesto funkcija u ovom "
"modulu jer pruža strujno sučelje za kompresiju i dekompresiju koje je "
"praktično i memorijski učinkovitije pri radu s čitanjem ili zapisivanjem "
"komprimiranih podataka u datoteku, utičnicu ili tok."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:18
msgid "**Availability:**"
msgstr "**Dostupnost:**"

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:20
msgid ""
"This module is **not included on the OpenMV Cam** by default, as it "
"duplicates functionality already provided by the :mod:`deflate <deflate>` "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul **nije uključen na OpenMV Cam** prema zadanim postavkama jer "
"duplicira funkcionalnost koju već pruža modul :mod:`deflate <deflate>`\\ ."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:24
msgid ""
"A copy can be installed (or frozen into custom firmware) from "
":term:`micropython-lib` (`source "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython-lib/blob/master/python-"
"stdlib/gzip/gzip.py>`_). See :ref:`packages` for more information. This "
"documentation describes that module."
msgstr ""
"Kopija se može instalirati (ili zamrznuti u prilagođeni ugrađeni program "
"(firmware)) iz :term:`micropython-lib` (\\ `izvor "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython-lib/blob/master/python-"
"stdlib/gzip/gzip.py>`_\\ ). Za više informacija pogledajte :ref:`packages`\\"
" . Ova dokumentacija opisuje taj modul."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:28
msgid ""
"Compression is only available if compression is available in the built-in "
":mod:`deflate <deflate>` module -- that is, not on the STM32-based OpenMV "
"Cams (see its availability note above)."
msgstr ""
"Kompresija je dostupna samo ako je kompresija dostupna u ugrađenom modulu "
":mod:`deflate <deflate>` -- to jest, ne na OpenMV Cam kamerama temeljenim na"
" STM32 (pogledajte napomenu o dostupnosti gore)."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:33
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:37
msgid "Wrapper around built-in :func:`open` returning a GzipFile instance."
msgstr "Omotač oko ugrađene :func:`open` koji vraća instancu GzipFile."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:41
msgid "Decompresses *data* into a bytes object."
msgstr "Dekomprimira *data* u bytes objekt."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:45
msgid "Compresses *data* into a bytes object."
msgstr "Komprimira *data* u bytes objekt."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:48
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klase"

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:52
msgid ""
"This class can be used to wrap a *fileobj* which is any :term:`stream-like "
"<stream>` object such as a file, socket, or stream (including "
":class:`io.BytesIO`). It is itself a stream and implements the standard "
"read/readinto/write/close methods."
msgstr ""
"Ova klasa može se koristiti za omatanje *fileobj* koji je bilo koji "
":term:`stream-like <stream>` objekt poput datoteke, utičnice ili toka "
"(uključujući :class:`io.BytesIO`\\ ). Sama je tok i implementira standardne "
"metode read/readinto/write/close."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:57
msgid ""
"When the *mode* argument is ``\"rb\"``, reads from the GzipFile instance "
"will decompress the data in the underlying stream and return decompressed "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Kada je argument *mode* ``\"rb\"``\\ , čitanja iz instance GzipFile "
"dekomprimirat će podatke u temeljnom toku i vratiti dekomprimirane podatke."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:60
msgid ""
"If compression support is enabled then the *mode* argument can be set to "
"``\"wb\"``, and writes to the GzipFile instance will be compressed and "
"written to the underlying stream."
msgstr ""
"Ako je podrška za kompresiju omogućena, tada se argument *mode* može "
"postaviti na ``\"wb\"``\\ , a zapisivanja u instancu GzipFile bit će "
"komprimirana i zapisana u temeljni tok."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:64
msgid ""
"By default the GzipFile class will read and write data using the gzip file "
"format, including a header and footer with checksum and a window size of 512"
" bytes."
msgstr ""
"Prema zadanim postavkama klasa GzipFile čitat će i zapisivati podatke "
"koristeći gzip format datoteke, uključujući zaglavlje i podnožje s "
"kontrolnim zbrojem te veličinom prozora od 512 bajtova."

#: ../../library/gzip.rst:68
msgid ""
"The **file**, **compresslevel**, and **mtime** arguments are not supported. "
"**fileobj** and **mode** must always be specified as keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
"Argumenti **file**\\ , **compresslevel** i **mtime** nisu podržani. "
"**fileobj** i **mode** moraju se uvijek navesti kao imenovani argumenti."

